00:01:52.185 --> 00:01:53.299
- Do you know what time I'm up

00:01:53.299 --> 00:01:54.160
- What?
- in the morning?

00:01:54.160 --> 00:01:55.497
- Brunch is the best.

00:01:55.497 --> 00:01:56.689
- This was a big loss.

00:01:56.689 --> 00:01:57.766
- This was a big loss,
- Yeah,

00:01:57.766 --> 00:01:59.002
- like I feel like
- I do realize.

00:01:59.002 --> 00:02:00.538
